"start": 54.800000000000004, "end": 57.120000000000005, "text": " Some robots are easy to identify.", "tokens": [50407, 2773, 14193, 389, 2562, 284, 5911, 13, 50523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09195431451948863, "compression_ratio": 1.4480874316939891, "no_speech_prob": 0.01123664528131485}, {"id": 14, "seek": 5392, "start": 57.120000000000005, "end": 60.72, "text": " The company replacing workers with a robot like Baxter here", "tokens": [50523, 383, 1664, 13586, 3259, 351, 257, 9379, 588, 46277, 994, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09195431451948863, "compression_ratio": 1.4480874316939891, "no_speech_prob": 0.01123664528131485}, {"id": 15, "seek": 5392, "start": 60.72, "end": 63.36, "text": " would be relatively straightforward to tax.", "tokens": [50703, 561, 307, 5365, 15836, 284, 1687, 13, 50835], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09195431451948863, "compression_ratio": 1.4480874316939891, "no_speech_prob": 0.01123664528131485}, {"id": 16, "seek": 5392, "start": 63.36, "end": 67.28, "text": " But this wave of innovation is not all about the physical world.", "tokens": [50835, 887, 428, 6769, 286, 11044, 318, 407, 477, 546, 262, 3518, 995, 13, 51031], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09195431451948863, "compression_ratio": 1.4480874316939891, "no_speech_prob": 0.01123664528131485}, {"id": 17, "seek": 5392, "start": 75.52000000000001, "end": 79.2, "text": " Much of this revolution, though, is taking place out of sight,", "tokens": [51443, 13111, 286, 428, 5854, 11, 996, 11, 318, 2263, 1295, 503, 286, 6504, 11, 51627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09195431451948863, "compression_ratio": 1.4480874316939891, "no_speech_prob": 0.01123664528131485}, {"id": 18, "seek": 7920, "start": 79.2, "end": 84.64, "text": " inside reassuringly familiar-looking computer cases and server racks.", "tokens": [50363, 2641, 36450, 306, 5385, 12, 11534, 3644, 2663, 290, 4382, 39843, 13, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1139785035