8297}, {"id": 36, "seek": 15368, "start": 153.68, "end": 156.16, "text": " For example, self-driving cars.", "tokens": [50363, 1114, 1672, 11, 2116, 12, 24255, 5006, 13, 50487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 37, "seek": 15368, "start": 156.72, "end": 160.08, "text": " Is that a person crossing the street,", "tokens": [50515, 1148, 326, 257, 1048, 12538, 262, 4675, 11, 50683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 38, "seek": 15368, "start": 160.08, "end": 163.76000000000002, "text": " or is it just water on the street mirroring something?", "tokens": [50683, 393, 318, 340, 655, 1660, 319, 262, 4675, 10162, 278, 1223, 30, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 39, "seek": 15368, "start": 163.76000000000002, "end": 165.92000000000002, "text": " Can I go on driving, or do I have to stop?", "tokens": [50867, 1680, 314, 467, 319, 5059, 11, 393, 466, 314, 423, 284, 2245, 30, 50975], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 40, "seek": 15368, "start": 165.92000000000002, "end": 168.8, "text": " That's understanding, interpretation work.", "tokens": [50975, 1320, 338, 4547, 11, 10794, 670, 13, 51119], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 41, "seek": 15368, "start": 168.8, "end": 173.04000000000002, "text": " And that's also the work that has to be done here for the accounting purposes.", "tokens": [51119, 843, 326, 338, 635, 262, 670, 326, 468, 284, 307, 1760, 994, 329, 262, 14317, 4959, 13, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 42, "seek": 15368, "start": 173.04000000000002, "end": 175.36, "text": " The system really needs to do the interpretation.", "tokens": [51331, 383, 1080, 1107, 2476, 284, 466, 262, 10794, 13, 51447], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 43, "seek": 15368, "start": 176.8, "end": 179.36, "text": " At SMAC, they say this will lead to less mundane,", "tokens": [51519, 1629, 9447, 2246, 11, 484, 910, 428, 481, 1085, 284, 1342, 30741, 11, 51647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 44, "seek": 15368, "start": 179.36, "end": 182.0, "text": " more interesting work for human accountants.", "tokens": [51647, 517, 3499, 670, 329, 1692, 1848, 1187, 13, 51779], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07734786323879077, "compression_ratio": 1.6377358490566039, "no_speech_prob": 0.04326191917061806}, {"id": 45, "seek": 18200, "start": 182.0, "end": 185.68, "text": " But again, the question is, how many of these human jobs will survive?", "tokens": [50363, 887, 757, 11, 262, 1808, 318, 11, 703, 867, 286, 777, 1692, 3946, 481, 7866, 30, 50547], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 46, "seek": 18200, "start": 186.56, "end": 190.24, "text": " We are progressing very, very quickly in terms of innovation,", "tokens": [50591, 775, 389, 37335, 845, 11, 845, 2952, 287, 2846, 286, 11044, 11, 50775], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 47, "seek": 18200, "start": 190.24, "end": 194.64, "text": " but we have no idea where we are heading and where we want to reach.", "tokens": [50775, 475, 356, 423, 645, 2126, 810, 356, 389, 9087, 290, 810, 356, 765, 284, 3151, 13, 50995], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 48, "seek": 18200, "start": 195.2, "end": 200.24, "text": " And I feel that at present, both governments and the private sector", "tokens": [51023, 843, 314, 1254, 326, 379, 1944, 11, 1111, 6905, 290, 262, 2839, 6567, 51275], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 49, "seek": 18200, "start": 200.24, "end": 204.88, "text": " are quite happy to rely on neoliberalism and market forces", "tokens": [51275, 389, 2407, 3772, 284, 8814, 319, 31972, 1042, 290, 1910, 3386, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 50, "seek": 18200, "start": 204.88, "end": 208.56, "text": " and allow them to decide the direction of innovation.", "tokens": [51507, 290, 1249, 606, 284, 5409, 262, 4571, 286, 11044, 13, 51691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 51, "seek": 18200, "start": 208.56, "end": 210.32, "text": " And this is extremely dangerous.", "tokens": [51691, 843, 428, 318, 4457, 4923, 13, 51779], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0832619571685791, "compression_ratio": 1.6147859922178989, "no_speech_prob": 0.026673341169953346}, {"id": 52, "seek": 21032, "start": 211.28, "end": 213.68, "text": " How dangerous? Well, don't take it from me.", "tokens": [50411, 1374, 4923, 30, 3894, 11, 836, 470, 1011, 340, 422, 502, 13, 50531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 53, "seek": 21032, "start": 214.64, "end": 217.51999999999998, "text": " Want to know where we could be heading as a species?", "tokens": [50579, 16168, 284, 760, 810, 356, 714, 307, 9087, 355, 257, 4693, 30, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 54, "seek": 21032, "start": 217.51999999999998, "end": 219.6, "text": " Have a look at our friend Oliver here.", "tokens": [50723, 8192, 257, 804, 379, 674, 1545, 15416, 994, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21032, "start": 219.6, "end": 223.44, "text": " Just a century ago, millions of horses in the UK could earn their keep", "tokens": [50827, 2329, 257, 4289, 2084, 11, 5242, 286, 14260, 287, 262, 3482, 714, 5160, 511, 1394, 51019], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21032, "start": 223.44, "end": 227.35999999999999, "text": " in agriculture, in the mines, in industry, in transport.", "tokens": [51019, 287, 14510, 11, 287, 262, 18446, 11, 287, 2831, 11, 287, 4839, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21032, "start": 228.4, "end": 232.56, "text": " The fact is that for almost every job that horses once monopolised,", "tokens": [51267, 383, 1109, 318, 326, 329, 2048, 790, 1693, 326, 14260, 1752, 30797, 1417, 11, 51475], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21032, "start": 232.56, "end": 235.35999999999999, "text": " today they're not worth their feed and stapling.", "tokens": [51475, 1909, 484, 821, 407, 2861, 511, 3745, 290, 336, 64, 11347, 13, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 59, "seek": 21032, "start": 236.0, "end": 238.72, "text": " They couldn't give their labour away at any price.", "tokens": [51647, 1119, 3521, 470, 1577, 511, 10515, 1497, 379, 597, 2756, 13, 51783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0852639757353684, "compression_ratio": 1.5962962962962963, "no_speech_prob": 0.006566005293279886}, {"id": 60, "seek": 23872, "start": 239.6, "end": 243.6, "text": " We can only hope that the robots are a little more sympathetic to us", "tokens": [50407, 775, 460, 691, 2911, 326, 262, 14193, 389, 257, 1310, 517, 22335, 284, 514, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16623922494741586, "compression_ratio": 1.1851851851851851, "no_speech_prob": 0.002869266550987959}, {"id": 61, "seek": 23872, "start": 243.6, "end": 245.2, "text": " than we were to the horses.", "tokens": [50607, 621, 356, 547, 284, 262, 14260, 13, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16623922494741586, "compression_ratio": 1.1851851851851851, "no_speech_prob": 0.002869266550987959}], "language": "English"}